# Chocolate Swirl Pistachio Ice Cream

Based on [https://sallysbakingaddiction.com/chocolate-swirl-pistachio-ice-cream](https://sallysbakingaddiction.com/chocolate-swirl-pistachio-ice-cream)

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Chocolate Ganache

- [ ] 6 Tbsps [heavy cream]{ ing="heavy-cream" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [quality chocolate chips]{ ing="quality-chocolate-chips" }

### Pistachio Ice Cream

- [ ] 1.25 cups [shelled roasted pistachios]{ ing="shelled-roasted-pistachios" }
- [ ] 2 cups [heavy cream]{ ing="heavy-cream" }, cold
- [ ] 14-ounce can full-fat [sweetened condensed milk]{ ing="sweetened-condensed-milk" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [pure vanilla extract]{ ing="pure-vanilla-extract" } or vanilla bean paste
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [almond extract]{ ing="almond-extract" }
- [ ] Optional: tiny drop green [gel food coloring]{ ing="gel-food-coloring" }

### Topping

- [ ] 2 Tbsps roughly [chopped pistachios]{ ing="chopped-pistachios" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsps roughly [chopped chocolate chips]{ ing="chopped-chocolate-chips" }

## Recipe

1. Heat [cream]{ ing="heavy-cream" } until simmering, pour over [chocolate chips]{ ing="quality-chocolate-chips" }, let sit 2-3 minutes, then stir until melted. Set aside to cool and thicken.
1. Pulse [pistachios]{ ing="chopped-pistachios" } in food processor until finely ground.
1. Beat cold [heavy cream]{ ing="heavy-cream" } on medium-high speed until stiff peaks form (about 4 minutes).
1. Add ground [pistachios]{ ing="chopped-pistachios" }, [condensed milk]{ ing="sweetened-condensed-milk" }, vanilla, [almond extract]{ ing="almond-extract" }, and [food coloring]{ ing="gel-food-coloring" } if desired. Beat on low speed until combined.
1. Spread half the ice [cream]{ ing="heavy-cream" } mixture into a freezer-safe container, add half the ganache in spoonfuls, top with remaining ice cream, then remaining ganache. Swirl gently with a knife. Top with [chopped pistachios]{ ing="chopped-pistachios" } and chocolate.
1. Cover and freeze at least 8 hours (up to 2 weeks).

## Notes

- This “no-churn method” doesn’t require an ice cream maker
